@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_GregIntro
Hoenn_Route119_Text_GregIntro::
	.string "You don't know who I am, do you?\p"
	.string "But, I also don't know you.\n"
	.string "So, we'll battle!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_GregDefeat
Hoenn_Route119_Text_GregDefeat::
	.string "You're pretty strong!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_GregPostBattle
Hoenn_Route119_Text_GregPostBattle::
	.string "Until you go away somewhere, we'll\n"
	.string "keep on mimicking your every move.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_TaylorIntro
Hoenn_Route119_Text_TaylorIntro::
	.string "If you step forward, we step forward.\p"
	.string "If you turn right, we turn, too…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_TaylorDefeat
Hoenn_Route119_Text_TaylorDefeat::
	.string "But if you win, I lose…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_TaylorPostBattle
Hoenn_Route119_Text_TaylorPostBattle::
	.string "I can't MIMIC you winning the match.\n"
	.string "That's just impossible…\l"
	.string "It's burning me up…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_DonaldIntro
Hoenn_Route119_Text_DonaldIntro::
	.string "So, we finally meet!\n"
	.string "My BUG POKéMON will keep you company!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_DonaldDefeat
Hoenn_Route119_Text_DonaldDefeat::
	.string "I wish we'd never met…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_DonaldPostBattle
Hoenn_Route119_Text_DonaldPostBattle::
	.string "I want to MIMIC you some more.\n"
	.string "Can you hurry up and move?$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_JacksonIntro
Hoenn_Route119_Text_JacksonIntro::
	.string "Who has the knowledge and\n"
	.string "the technique for survival?\p"
	.string "POKéMON RANGERS, that's who!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_JacksonDefeat
Hoenn_Route119_Text_JacksonDefeat::
	.string "I didn't have enough POKéMON\n"
	.string "know-how…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_JacksonPostBattle
Hoenn_Route119_Text_JacksonPostBattle::
	.string "To break away from civilization and\n"
	.string "awaken the wild spirit within!\p"
	.string "That's our vision.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_BrentIntro
Hoenn_Route119_Text_BrentIntro::
	.string "We're the MIMIC CIRCLE!\n"
	.string "We MIMIC what you do!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_BrentDefeat
Hoenn_Route119_Text_BrentDefeat::
	.string "Whoopsie!\n"
	.string "I lost!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_BrentPostBattle
Hoenn_Route119_Text_BrentPostBattle::
	.string "What's so good about mimicry?\p"
	.string "Fufufu…\n"
	.string "You'll never understand…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_CatherineIntro
Hoenn_Route119_Text_CatherineIntro::
	.string "Oh? Look at you.\p"
	.string "For someone on an adventure,\n"
	.string "you're traveling awfully light.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_CatherineDefeat
Hoenn_Route119_Text_CatherineDefeat::
	.string "Accidents happen when you're not\n"
	.string "prepared!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_CatherinePostBattle
Hoenn_Route119_Text_CatherinePostBattle::
	.string "You're traveling light but you have\n"
	.string "everything you need.\p"
	.string "You're on top of things mentally and\n"
	.string "physically, too.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_DougIntro
Hoenn_Route119_Text_DougIntro::
	.string "Yep, you've finally caught me!\n"
	.string "Or were you trying to avoid me?$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_DougDefeat
Hoenn_Route119_Text_DougDefeat::
	.string "Whoop, that was a great match!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_DougPostBattle
Hoenn_Route119_Text_DougPostBattle::
	.string "We're the MIMIC CIRCLE!\n"
	.string "I hope you enjoyed our performance.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_KentIntro
Hoenn_Route119_Text_KentIntro::
	.string "The MIMIC CIRCLE was formed by people\n"
	.string "who like to MIMIC.\p"
	.string "A battle starts the instant we meet!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_KentDefeat
Hoenn_Route119_Text_KentDefeat::
	.string "I give up!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_KentPostBattle
Hoenn_Route119_Text_KentPostBattle::
	.string "Won't you join our MIMIC CIRCLE?$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_YasuIntro
Hoenn_Route119_Text_YasuIntro::
	.string "To lurk in shadows, and live in\n"
	.string "darkness… That is my destiny.\p"
	.string "I emerge to challenge you!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_YasuDefeat
Hoenn_Route119_Text_YasuDefeat::
	.string "I admit defeat!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_YasuPostBattle
Hoenn_Route119_Text_YasuPostBattle::
	.string "Those defeated in battle withdraw\n"
	.string "quietly back into the shadows.\l"
	.string "That, too, is destiny…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_TakashiIntro
Hoenn_Route119_Text_TakashiIntro::
	.string "If you're not on your guard,\n"
	.string "you're in for some pain!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_TakashiDefeat
Hoenn_Route119_Text_TakashiDefeat::
	.string "You're surprisingly good!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_TakashiPostBattle
Hoenn_Route119_Text_TakashiPostBattle::
	.string "My surprise attack ended in\n"
	.string "failure…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_HughIntro
Hoenn_Route119_Text_HughIntro::
	.string "The vast sky holds untold promise!\p"
	.string "Nothing can compare to the sheer\n"
	.string "exhilaration of flight!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_HughDefeat
Hoenn_Route119_Text_HughDefeat::
	.string "Down and out!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_HughPostBattle
Hoenn_Route119_Text_HughPostBattle::
	.string "My BIRD POKéMON made my dreams of\n"
	.string "flying come true!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_PhilIntro
Hoenn_Route119_Text_PhilIntro::
	.string "I'll show you the true potential of me\n"
	.string "and my BIRD POKéMON!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_PhilDefeat
Hoenn_Route119_Text_PhilDefeat::
	.string "We lacked potential…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_PhilPostBattle
Hoenn_Route119_Text_PhilPostBattle::
	.string "Ever since I was a little kid, I always\n"
	.string "admired BIRD POKéMON…$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/Route119/scripts.inc: Route119_Text_ThoughtFlyByCatchingBirdMons
Hoenn_Route119_Text_ThoughtFlyByCatchingBirdMons::
	.string "I thought you FLY by catching a whole\n"
	.string "flock of BIRD POKéMON, and then\l"
	.string "hanging on to them somehow.\p"
	.string "But it turns out there's an HM move\n"
	.string "called FLY!\p"
	.string "I wish I'd known about that a long\n"
	.string "time ago…$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/Route119/scripts.inc: Route119_Text_TallGrassSnaresBikeTires
Hoenn_Route119_Text_TallGrassSnaresBikeTires::
	.string "Tch…\n"
	.string "It's a no-go…\p"
	.string "The tall grass snares BIKE tires.\n"
	.string "There's no way you can cycle here.$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/Route119/scripts.inc: Route119_Text_CanYourMonMakeSecretBase
Hoenn_Route119_Text_CanYourMonMakeSecretBase::
	.string "Can your POKéMON use its SECRET POWER\n"
	.string "on a big pile of grass and make a\l"
	.string "SECRET BASE?$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_HideoIntro
Hoenn_Route119_Text_HideoIntro::
	.string "To hide a tree, use a forest!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_HideoDefeat
Hoenn_Route119_Text_HideoDefeat::
	.string "I bow to your superiority.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_HideoPostBattle
Hoenn_Route119_Text_HideoPostBattle::
	.string "To hide a tree, use a forest!\n"
	.string "To hide a POKéMON, use a POKéMON!\p"
	.string "There is no deep, hidden meaning\n"
	.string "to that.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_ChrisIntro
Hoenn_Route119_Text_ChrisIntro::
	.string "You spoke to me…\n"
	.string "So you want to challenge me!\p"
	.string "Sure! I'll try out the POKéMON I caught\n"
	.string "while SURFING!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_ChrisDefeat
Hoenn_Route119_Text_ChrisDefeat::
	.string "I don't have a clue about what it\n"
	.string "takes to win.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_ChrisPostBattle
Hoenn_Route119_Text_ChrisPostBattle::
	.string "Go for a SURF on my POKéMON…\p"
	.string "Then fish off its back…\p"
	.string "It's an indescribably luxuriant moment!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_RachelIntro
Hoenn_Route119_Text_RachelIntro::
	.string "Wherever and whenever I may be,\n"
	.string "I always have my parasol in hand.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_RachelDefeat
Hoenn_Route119_Text_RachelDefeat::
	.string "Oh, but…\n"
	.string "That's not fair.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_RachelPostBattle
Hoenn_Route119_Text_RachelPostBattle::
	.string "You're asking if my parasol is heavy?\n"
	.string "Your BAG is filled with more junk than\l"
	.string "I ever carry around.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_DaytonIntro
Hoenn_Route119_Text_DaytonIntro::
	.string "Hohoho!\n"
	.string "I like kid TRAINERS!\l"
	.string "Let's have a good one!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_DaytonDefeat
Hoenn_Route119_Text_DaytonDefeat::
	.string "You're pretty amazing!\n"
	.string "Hohoho!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_DaytonPostBattle
Hoenn_Route119_Text_DaytonPostBattle::
	.string "Hohoho!\n"
	.string "I'll try emulating the pep of kid\l"
	.string "TRAINERS like you!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_FabianIntro
Hoenn_Route119_Text_FabianIntro::
	.string "Hit me with a power chord!\n"
	.string "Victory is mine!\l"
	.string "It's our time to shine, whoa, yeah!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_FabianDefeat
Hoenn_Route119_Text_FabianDefeat::
	.string "You showed me who's the boss!\n"
	.string "We'll have to take the loss, oh, no!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route119_Text_FabianPostBattle
Hoenn_Route119_Text_FabianPostBattle::
	.string "Hit me with another power chord!\n"
	.string "Leave me alone!\l"
	.string "Your win you have to atone!$"

